# Objective:
Retrieve the password for bandit11 stored in data.txt, which contains Base64 encoded data

# breakdown:
Base64 encodes binary or text data into printable ASCII format.
 Running base64 with the -d (decode) flag reverses this process and decodes the content of data.txt back into human-readable plain text.

Command:
base64 -d data.txt
